\n</tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"2\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/36px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Armour Class</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"1\"><p>12</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"2\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/24px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/36px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/24px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Size</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"1\"><p>Tiny</p></td>\n</tr></tbody></table><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Beak_Attack_(Dire_Raven)\" title=\"Beak Attack (Dire Raven)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Beak_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Beak_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Beak_Attack_Icon.webp/60px-Beak_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Beak_Attack_Icon.webp/80px-Beak_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Beak Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Beak_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Beak_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Beak_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Beak_Attack_(Dire_Raven)\" title=\"Beak Attack (Dire Raven)\">Beak Attack</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Peck at a target. </dd>\n</dl><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(class_action)\" title=\"Fly (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/40px-Fly_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/60px-Fly_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/80px-Fly_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/40px-Fly_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(class_action)\" title=\"Fly (class action)\">Fly</a> (<span aria-label=\"Movement Speed (Half cost)\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png/23px-Movement_Speed_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Movement Speed (Half cost)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png/23px-Movement_Speed_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Fly to a target position </dd>\n</dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<p>Due to a bug in the code, while in Blue Jay form, you cannot use the Beak Attack action on your turn. However if an opportunity attack is triggered, you can use Beak Attack for the OA.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Polymorph_Self\">Sources of Polymorph Self</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shapechanger\" title=\"Shapechanger\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Shapechanger_Icon.webp/30px-Shapechanger_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Shapechanger_Icon.webp/45px-Shapechanger_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Shapechanger_Icon.webp/60px-Shapechanger_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shapechanger\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Shapechanger_Icon.webp/30px-Shapechanger_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Shapechanger_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shapechanger\" title=\"Shapechanger\">Shapechanger</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>POLYMORPH</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Alternate_Form:_Dire_Wolf\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Dire_Wolf_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Dire Wolf (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alternate Form: Dire Wolf\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Dire_Wolf_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Dire Wolf (Condition)\">Alternate Form: Dire Wolf</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Transformed into a Dire Wolf in all the ways that matter.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Alternate_Form:_Minotaur\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Minotaur_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Minotaur (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alternate Form: Minotaur\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Minotaur_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Minotaur (Condition)\">Alternate Form: Minotaur</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Transformed into a Minotaur in all the ways that matter.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Alternate_Form:_Phase_Spider\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Phase_Spider_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Phase Spider (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alternate Form: Phase Spider\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Phase_Spider_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Phase Spider (Condition)\">Alternate Form: Phase Spider</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Transformed into a Phase Spider in all the ways that matter.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Alternate_Form:_Shadow_Mastiff\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Shadow_Mastiff_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Shadow Mastiff (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alternate Form: Shadow Mastiff\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Shadow_Mastiff_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Shadow Mastiff (Condition)\">Alternate Form: Shadow Mastiff</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Transformed into a Shadow Mastiff in all the ways that matter.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Big_Pig\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Big_Pig_(Condition)\" title=\"Big Pig (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Big Pig\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Big_Pig_(Condition)\" title=\"Big Pig (Condition)\">Big Pig</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Pigs are smart and pigs are fun - that's why Dolly made you one!</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Cattle_Prattle\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cattle_Prattle_(Condition)\" title=\"Cattle Prattle (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cattle Prattle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Cattle_Prattle_(Condition)\" title=\"Cattle Prattle (Condition)\">Cattle Prattle</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Want to converse like a cow? Dolly Thrice will show you how.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Polymorph\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorph_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorph (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorph\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorph_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorph (Condition)\">Polymorph</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>You are now a particularly ripe wheel of cheese, unpleasant to the nostril.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Polymorph_Self\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorph_Self_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorph Self (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorph Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Polymorph Self</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Transformed into a blue jay, able to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(class_action)\" title=\"Fly (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/25px-Fly_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/38px-Fly_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/50px-Fly_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/25px-Fly_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(class_action)\" title=\"Fly (class action)\">Fly</a> for 5 rounds.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Polymorphed\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorphed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Condition)\">Polymorphed</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Creature is turned into a harmless sheep with 3 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a> for 5 turns.</li>\n<li>If the sheep's Hit Points are reduced to 0, the creature reverts to its original form with its original Hit Points.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Polymorphed\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Tressym)_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Tressym) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorphed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/58/Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Tressym)_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Tressym) (Condition)\">Polymorphed</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Changed into a beast.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Toad_Mode\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Toad_Mode_(Condition)\" title=\"Toad Mode (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Toad Mode\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Toad_Mode_(Condition)\" title=\"Toad Mode (Condition)\">Toad Mode</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>If you do not want to think, Dolly Thrice will make you shrink.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715164408\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.114 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.121 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5207/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 69816/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12960/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.060/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1532137/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   96.210      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   96.210      1 -total\n 33.36%   32.100      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 29.74%   28.610     18 Template:Icon_text\n 26.75%   25.739     15 Template:Icon_link\n 23.70%   22.799     46 Template:Trim\n 17.59%   16.925   